C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XMg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c083083-5827-44ae-8b3e-cf6fe3b75060","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"大人になってから大学入り直しても高校の実績ですか？（錯乱）","ts":"1617174105.470700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O/AEB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7cee116-26d6-453f-964b-0c33d184512c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"医学部難しすぎて笑えない・・・","ts":"1617174080.470400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cEZ9F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa6e8d23-f33c-4d41-b736-79a5169f8c4d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"医学部目指す浪人生は結構いた","ts":"1617174049.470000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4PI5E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33dba9ad-b03f-4550-b61d-ba99d84c2bf7","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"自分のところは有名大への進学は浪人生多かったきがする","ts":"1617173937.469500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OVx8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffee54aa-5524-40c7-b374-5b9e656c42b0","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://nnn.ed.jp/news/blog/archives/12526.html\u003e","ts":"1617173897.469200","attachments":[{"fallback":"N高等学校・S高等学校: 当学園の進学率、および就職率に関する ご説明につきまして | N高等学校・S高等学校(通信制高校 広域・単位制)","id":1,"title":"当学園の進学率、および就職率に関する ご説明につきまして | N高等学校・S高等学校(通信制高校 広域・単位制)","title_link":"https://nnn.ed.jp/news/blog/archives/12526.html","text":"N高等学校・S高等学校(通信制高校 広域・単位制)のニュースを紹介。学校法人角川ドワンゴ学園のニュース、プレスリリースなどを紹介します。N高、S高はインターネットと通信制高校の制度を活用したネットの高校です。多様なスキル、さまざまな体験を得られる多くの学びの場があります。","image_url":"https://nnn.ed.jp/assets/img/logo_ogp.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"N高等学校・S高等学校","service_icon":"https://n